{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"唯一分解整环"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“唯一分解整环”"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>$\\mathbb{Z}[\\sqrt{-5}]$ 不是唯一分解整环: $6=2\\times 3 = (1+\\sqrt{-5})(1-\\sqrt{-5})$.</p>\n"}}